---
source: tests/golden.rs
expression: stdout
---
Read or write CLI config values.

USAGE
  basin config [args]

FLAGS / SUBCOMMANDS
  show                          Print the on-disk config.
  get <key>                     Print one key.
  set <key> <value>             Persist a key.
  
  Keys:
    telemetry                   on|off  (anonymous usage pings; default off)
